# Optional REST API base URL for real reservation persistence
# When omitted, the app uses hardened localStorage persistence for demo/static hosting.
# Expected endpoints when set:
#   GET   {VITE_RESERVATION_API_URL}/reservations
#   GET   {VITE_RESERVATION_API_URL}/slots?date=YYYY-MM-DD
#   POST  {VITE_RESERVATION_API_URL}/reservations
#   PATCH {VITE_RESERVATION_API_URL}/reservations/:id/cancel
VITE_RESERVATION_API_URL=
